        -:  302:	//PolyTree: is intended as a READ-ONLY data structure for CLOSED paths returned
        -:  303:	//by clipping operations. While this structure is more complex than the
        -:  304:	//alternative Paths structure, it does preserve path 'ownership' - ie those
        -:  305:	//paths that contain (or own) other paths. This will be useful to some users.
